OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm 90 now. My town crier uniform
OL,4,Ais too heavy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's most recognisable town
OL,7,Fcriers is hanging up his handbell aged
OL,8,F90.
OL,10,FTony Appleton found himself on
OL,11,Fnewspaper front pages across the globe
OL,12,Fwhen he turned up uninvited outside St
OL,13,FMary's Hospital in London, in July
OL,14,F2013, and bellowed news of Prince
OL,15,FGeorge's birth.
OL,17,FHe has continued the tradition for
OL,18,FGeorge's two siblings.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
