OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm 90 now. My town crier uniform
OL,4,Ais too heavy'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's sad, but there comes a time in
OL,7,Flife when you've got to say, 'well
OL,8,Fthat's it', otherwise you make yourself
OL,9,Flook a bit of a fool," said Appleton,
OL,10,Ffrom Chelmsford.
